1. **The Mermaid Diagram:** I included a `mermaid.js` sequence diagram in the markdown. GitHub natively renders this! It will instantly show the hiring manager the exact flow of the self-healing loop without them having to read a wall of text.
2. **The Architecture Image:** Make sure you actually create `docs/architecture_diagram.png`. Use a tool like **Excalidraw** or **Draw.io**. A messy whiteboard sketch is okay, but a clean, color-coded box-and-arrow diagram is much better.
3. **The Demo Video:** Record a quick 2-3 minute Loom video. Show your terminal. Run a script that injects "drift" into Kafka. Show the Grafana dashboard turning red. Show the GitHub Action triggering. Show ArgoCD deploying the new pod. **Link this video at the top.** This single video will get you more interviews than the code itself.
